---json
{
  "layout": "layouts/page.njk",
  "title": "See your stock position weeks ahead — Practical Supply Chain Planning",
  "description": "Time-phased planning projects stock forward against your forecast, open orders and lead times. For small product businesses with CSV exports.",
  "canonical": "https://practicalsupplychainplanning.com/start/plan-ahead/",
  "permalink": "/start/plan-ahead/"
}
---
{%- set photo = home.photoUrl | publicAsset -%}
{%- set photoWebp = home.photoWebpUrl | publicAsset -%}
<h1 class="page-title">See your stock position weeks ahead, before it runs short or piles up.</h1>
<p class="tagline">Time-phased planning projects stock forward against your forecast, open orders and lead times.</p>

<section class="card" aria-labelledby="problem-heading">
  <h2 class="card__title" id="problem-heading">The problem</h2>
  <div class="content">
    <p>Reordering by gut feel or spreadsheet, and finding out too late.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="card" aria-labelledby="how-heading">
  <h2 class="card__title" id="how-heading">How it works</h2>
  <div class="content">
    <p>Practical Stock Planner projects stock week by week from your forecast, open orders and lead times.</p>
    <p>Planned orders are timed to arrive before stock drops below safety stock.</p>
  </div>
  <figure class="home-chart">
    <img
      src="/images/IMG000009.webp"
      alt="Practical Stock Planner inventory projection, with projected stock across the weeks of the plan."
      width="1536"
      height="1024"
    />
  </figure>
</section>

<section class="card" aria-labelledby="who-heading">
  <h2 class="card__title" id="who-heading">Who it&rsquo;s for</h2>
  <div class="content">
    <p>Small product businesses with CSV exports, for example Shopify, Xero or Cin7.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="card" aria-labelledby="built-heading">
  <h2 class="card__title" id="built-heading">Built by a working planner</h2>
  <div class="home-founder">
    {%- if photo %}
    <picture>
      {%- if photoWebp %}
      <source srcset="{{ photoWebp }}" type="image/webp" />
      {%- endif %}
      <img
        class="home-portrait"
        src="{{ photo }}"
        alt="{{ home.photoAlt }}"
        width="312"
        height="312"
      />
    </picture>
    {%- endif %}
    <div class="content">
      <p>Built by Daniel Hampton, a working supply chain planner.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{%- if paddle.checkoutOpen %}
<p class="home-actions">
  <a class="home-button" href="/products/practical-stock-planner/#price">Start your free trial</a>
</p>
{%- else %}
{% set kitTitle = "Join the list" %}
{% include "partials/keep-in-touch.njk" %}
{%- endif %}

<section class="card" aria-labelledby="start-faq-heading">
  <h2 class="card__title" id="start-faq-heading">Questions</h2>
  <div class="content">
    <h3>Where does my data go?</h3>
    <p>Your data stays in CSV files. No integration is needed.</p>
    <p>More answers are on the <a href="/faq/">FAQ page</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>
